+*   **Strengths:** Captures qualitative appearance of translucency, color bleeding, and volumetric shadows at interactive rates [S1]. Works with arbitrary volumes and scanned data without restrictions on optical properties or external illumination [S1].
 *   **Limitations:** Not quantitatively accurate. Does not model full global illumination, backward scattering, or volumetric emission [S1]. Relies on empirical parameters ($S(s)$, $\theta$) that may require tuning [S1].
 
